# Files that exist in this directory for development but must NEVER be served.
# Without this list the whole directory is published as static assets — which is
# how /src/index.js, /DEPLOY.md, /README.md, /fetch-icons.sh were all publicly
# readable on the live site (verified 200 OK, Sep 2026).
#
# _partials/ : source fragments used to build the <nav>/<footer> markup
# src/       : the Worker source itself
# *.md, *.sh : runbooks and dev scripts
# wrangler.jsonc: build config
# .wrangler/ : local build state
_partials/
src/
.wrangler/
DEPLOY.md
README.md
fetch-icons.sh
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
.oc-tmp/
# Scratch font test pages (underscore-prefixed); keep them unpublished.
_fntest*.html
